theorem k215UnpairAt4247Step12 (a b n c: nat): $ k215PStep (k215UnpairAt4247State k215PNum4250 a b n c) = (k215UnpairAt4247State k215PNum4254 a b n c) $ = '(k215PAtCB k215PLookupUnpair4247_4250);

