theorem k215UnpairAt4247Reach16 (a b n c: nat): $ k215PReach (k215UnpairAt4247State k215PNum4254 a b n c) (k215UnpairAt4247State k215PNum4247 a b n c) $ = '(k215PReach_step k215UnpairAt4247Step16);

theorem k215UnpairAt4247CycleZero (b n c: nat): $ k215PReach (k215UnpairAt4247State k215PNum4247 0 b (suc n) c) (k215UnpairAt4247State k215PNum4247 (suc b) 0 n c) $ = '(ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt4247Reach9S) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt4247Reach10) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt4247Reach11Z) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt4247ReachTransfer) k215UnpairAt4247Reach16))));
